            "language": "plaintext",
            "showLineNumbers": false,
            "showMiniMap": false
          },
          "content": "## Bot Insights\n\n**Bot Insights provides long term visibility into how known bots are interacting with your web properties.**\n\nUnderstand high-level bot request trends, with a specific focus on AI bots. This dashboard works best when querying data from multiple days, weeks, or months and is designed to surface long term trends.",
          "mode": "markdown"
        },
        "pluginVersion": "12.2.3",
        "type": "text"
